NAME
    cd - Change the userland shell current directory. Relative paths, parent navigation and an immediate return to the root are supported.

SYNOPSIS
    cd <folder_name> | cd .. | cd \

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Change the userland shell current directory. Relative paths, parent navigation and an immediate return to the root are supported.

EXAMPLES
    cd INU
    cd ..
    cd \

FILES
    /System/Commands/CD.CMD
    /INU/HELP/CD.MAN
